**Caveat:** This is a code, CI-log, manifest, and documentation audit. Local build and live production health **not verified**. When a later push lands, re-check HEAD and update statuses before acting.

## Status legend

- **CODE**: implementation files or registered endpoints demonstrably present; **not** proof of runtime readiness.
- **PARTIAL**: UI/proxy/scaffold exists but the named feature is not end-to-end.
- **TODO**: implementation/evidence absent from inspected files.
- **BLOCKED**: known failing CI or release gate.
- Every `- [ ]` below is **unverified or unfinished** until the specified acceptance evidence has been attached. Do not silently mark code presence as production-done.

## Product hierarchy and route ownership (proposed)

- **Empire of the Light / A-L-L-A-H**: parent brand, core technologies, ARSY, governance, foundational modules.
- **MOONWITNESS**: primary public editorial universe and product. `/` is already the MoonWitness homepage.
- **SHADOW**: MoonWitness creative/editorial operator experience. Existing authenticated route is `/workspace`; optional `/shadow` alias must be a deliberate product choice, not a second API/access boundary.
- **100CENTER**: core operations, research, system/tenant/admin, monitoring and human governance. Keep it distinct in navigation and privileges (even when initially within the same application/runtime).
- **Fastify / PostgreSQL**: canonical local API + persistence, no browser-to-DB access; Gen2 shared capability ownership subject to ADR.

