- [ ] **MW-OPS-07 / Security** — Test rate limits, brute force, CSRF/origin for remember-cookie mutation, CORS, document signed URLs, tenant isolation, access to `/workspace` without login. **DoD:** negative tests included in CI and deployed smoke.
- [ ] **MW-OPS-08 / Observability** — Add deployment/audit/error logs with correlation ID; distinguish service health from editorial publishing and audience metrics. **DoD:** failures show traceable operational messages without secrets.
