## Design generation queue — do this in parallel with Release Recovery, not instead of it

- [ ] **DES-01** Public **Universe/Collections** full-page web mockup, 16:9 or 1920×1080, grunge/manga lines like approved screenshot, covers for actual series, filters/search/episode counts only if grounded.
